{% comment %}
Prompt B's user message, in three parts.

The goal as written — its comments, steps and indentation, each step `[i]` followed by the actions
the decider allowed it (`→`).

Types — what each type a value can take already knows about itself, off the catalogue: the literal
types first (text, number, bool, list, dict), then every type a listed action's properties use, in
the order the goal first reaches them. A line holds the type's Description, a choice's options and
its Example, whichever it has.

Then every listed action ONCE, however many steps list it: its signature, the first line of its
description, its notes (their headings one level down, under the action's own `##`).

The menu holds plang text, so each entry is captured to a Liquid string before it is compared. A
module's actions and its modifiers are two lists (m.Action, m.Modifier); a menu can name either.
A step line longer than 72 characters does not widen the `→` column.
{% endcomment %}{%- assign width = 0 -%}
{%- for s in goal.Step -%}
{%- capture line -%}[{{ s.Index }}] {% for k in (1..s.Indent) %}    {% endfor %}- {{ s.Text }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign n = line | size -%}
{%- if n > width and n <= 72 -%}{%- assign width = n -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
Goal, as written:
  {{ goal.Name }}
{%- for s in goal.Step -%}
{%- capture indent -%}{% for k in (1..s.Indent) %}    {% endfor %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if s.Comment -%}
{%- assign commentLines = s.Comment | split: "\n" -%}
{%- for c in commentLines %}
      {{ indent }}/ {{ c }}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- capture line -%}[{{ s.Index }}] {{ indent }}- {{ s.Text }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign n = line | size -%}
{%- assign pad = width | minus: n | plus: 3 -%}
{%- if n > width -%}{%- assign pad = 3 -%}{%- endif %}
  {{ line }}{% for k in (1..pad) %} {% endfor %}→ {% for e in menu[s.Index] %}{{ e }}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign faces = "|text|number|bool|list|dict|" -%}
{%- for s in goal.Step -%}
{%- for e in menu[s.Index] -%}
{%- capture choice -%}{{ e }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- for m in modules -%}
{%- assign actions = m.Action | concat: m.Modifier -%}
{%- for a in actions -%}
{%- assign name = m.Name | append: "." | append: a.Name -%}
{%- if name == choice -%}
{%- for p in a.Property -%}
{%- capture face -%}{{ p.Type }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mark = "|" | append: face | append: "|" -%}
{%- unless faces contains mark -%}{%- assign faces = faces | append: face | append: "|" -%}{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor %}

Types
{%- assign faceList = faces | split: "|" -%}
{%- for want in faceList -%}
{%- if want != "" -%}
{%- assign found = false -%}
{%- for m in modules -%}
{%- assign actions = m.Action | concat: m.Modifier -%}
{%- for a in actions -%}
{%- for p in a.Property -%}
{%- unless found -%}
{%- capture face -%}{{ p.Type }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if face == want -%}
{%- assign found = true %}
- {{ face }}{% if p.Type.Description %} — {{ p.Type.Description }}{% endif %}{% if p.Type.Values %} — one of: {{ p.Type.Values | join: ", " }}{% endif %}{% if p.Type.Example %} (e.g. {{ p.Type.Example }}){% endif %}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endunless -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
{%- assign printed = "|" -%}
{%- for s in goal.Step -%}
{%- for e in menu[s.Index] -%}
{%- capture choice -%}{{ e }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mark = "|" | append: choice | append: "|" -%}
{%- unless printed contains mark -%}
{%- assign printed = printed | append: choice | append: "|" -%}
{%- for m in modules -%}
{%- assign actions = m.Action | concat: m.Modifier -%}
{%- for a in actions -%}
{%- assign name = m.Name | append: "." | append: a.Name -%}
{%- if name == choice %}

## {{ choice }}({% for p in a.Property %}{{ p.Name }}{% unless p.Required or p.HasDefault %}?{% endunless %}: {{ p.Type }}{% if p.HasDefault %} = {{ p.Default }}{% endif %}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %})
{%- if a.Description -%}
{%- assign descriptionLines = a.Description | strip | split: "\n" %}
{{ descriptionLines[0] }}
